{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t天文台在凌晨4時45分發出強烈季候風信號。預料本港吹偏北強風，平均風速每小時超過四十公里。陣風間中達烈風程度。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯︰張萬燕\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T21:55:51.334863+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":62,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T21:23:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T02:17:32.596090+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T21:49:19.621555+00:00","content_hash":"2f7849542fc1b1250601e6c1585a9ff4a26e2529918ffcad595460574ea32489","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}